{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-26T10:50:38Z","model":"gemini-4-hydrogen-high","input_tokens":20195,"cache_read_tokens":99316,"output_tokens":4159,"thinking":"Initial rate limit error on asset generation requires splitting requests into smaller batches to prevent service throttling. Prioritizing logo retry alongside primary vehicle views before proceeding to remaining exterior and interior shots.\n\nEarlier command execution failures stemmed from path permission restrictions rather than environment limits. AI session logs cannot be artificially generated per repository requirements, necessitating explicit instructions for manual export. Structuring documentation requirements to include mandatory placeholder links for deployment and feedback forms within the project overview.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"update_steps","args":{"steps":"[{\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"title\":\"Organize folders and generate images\"},{\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Create shared CSS and car data\"},{\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Build Home, Explore, and Details pages\"},{\"status\":\"done\",\"title\":\"Implement interactive JS and booking flow\"},{\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"title\":\"Update README and CL1000 docs\"},{\"status\":\"pending\",\"title\":\"Verify functionality and Git status\"}]"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# CarVault\\n\\n**Theme #54:** Car showroom and dealership (Community & Lifestyle)  \\n**Tagline:** Find Your Perfect Car — A modern brand-new car dealership web application built with HTML5, CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript.\\n\\n## Links\\n- **Live Website:** `[Add deployed GitHub Pages / Netlify link before submission]`\\n- **Google Form (User Feedback):** `[Add group Google Form link before submission]`\\n\\n## Feature Table\\n\\n| Feature | Category | Page | Member |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| Featured cars & popular brands rendered from `CAR_VAULT_CARS` array | Data & Display | Home (`index.html`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Dynamic car catalog grid with real-time search, brand/price/type filters & sorting | Data & Display | Explore Cars (`pages/explore-cars.html`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Dynamic Car Details view loaded via URL `?id=...` query parameter | Data & Display | Car Details (`pages/car-details.html`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| 4-State Test Drive Booking Form (Empty, Filled, Success, Failed Validation) | Forms & Input | Car Details & Navbar Modal | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Search input & multi-criteria filter panel with Apply/Reset controls | Forms & Input | Explore Cars (`pages/explore-cars.html`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Persistent Wishlist (`Saved Cars`) & demo booking storage using `localStorage` | State & Memory | All Pages (`js/common.js`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Interactive 3-thumbnail gallery switcher (`other views`) | Interaction | Car Details (`pages/car-details.html`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Saved Cars modal viewer & Test Drive booking modal | Interaction | All Pages (`js/common.js`) | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| PKR price-range bracket logic, sorting & Monthly Installment Estimator | Logic & Calculation | Explore Cars & Car Details | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n| Mobile hamburger navigation, collapsible mobile filters, semantic HTML & focus states | Responsive & Accessible | All 3 Pages | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) |\\n\\n## Contribution Table\\n\\n| Name | Rol\n<truncated 1419 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\CarVault project\\\\README.md\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# CAR VAULT — Code Explanation & Documentation (Hamza Taqvim, 26I-3054)\\n\\nThis guide explains how your 3 pages work in simple English so you can confidently present the project and answer viva questions.\\n\\n## 1. File Organization\\n- **`index.html` (Home Page):** Shows the `CAR VAULT` header, *\\\"Find Your Perfect Car\\\"* heading, hero image, 4 stat boxes (`80+ Vehicles`, `06 Luxury Brands`, `100% Passion`, `24/7 Support`), **Explore Cars** button, **Featured Cars** (`BMW M5`, `Mercedes C400`), **Popular Brands** links, and footer.\\n- **`pages/explore-cars.html` (Explore Cars Page):** Shows the *\\\"Explore Our Cars\\\"* heading, search bar, sort dropdown, left **FILTERS** sidebar (Brand, Price, Type + **Apply** / **Reset** buttons), and responsive car grid.\\n- **`pages/car-details.html` (Car Details Page):** Shows breadcrumbs (`Home / Explore Cars / [Car Name]`), main photo + 3 clickable thumbnails, car specs (`Brand New · 2026`, Price, Engine, Fuel, Transmission, Type), **BOOK** button, **Wishlist** button, Description, and Monthly Installment Estimator.\\n\\n## 2. How the CSS Works\\n- **`css/common.css`:** Defines CSS variables in `:root` for the theme (`--navy: #111827`, `--gold: #d9a441`, `--white: #ffffff`, `--light-grey: #f3f4f6`), shared buttons, navbar, car cards, footer, and modal dialogs.\\n- **`css/pages.css`:** Styles page-specific layouts (like the 2-column Featured grid, Explore sidebar + grid, Details split view) and uses `@media` queries for mobile responsiveness.\\n\\n## 3. How the JavaScript Connects Everything\\n1. **`js/cars-data.js`:** Holds `CAR_VAULT_CARS`, an array of 10 brand-new 2026 car objects. Each object stores `id`, `brand`, `model`, `price` (numeric PKR), `priceLabel`, `type`, `engine`, `fuel`, `transmission`, `image`, `gallery`, and `description`.\\n2. **`js/common.js`:**\\n   - Injects the shared navbar and footer using `PATH_PREFIX` (`\\\"\\\"` on root, `\\\"../\\\"` inside `pages/`).\\n   - Manages the **Wishlist** using `localStorage.getItem(\\\"carvault_wishlist\\\")` and `localStorage.setItem(..\n<truncated 1507 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\CarVault project\\\\docs\\\\documentation.md\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# CAR VAULT — Testing Log (Hamza Taqvim, 26I-3054)\\n\\nRecord manual browser tests (desktop and mobile) here before merging into `main`.\\n\\n| Test ID | Page / Feature | Steps Taken | Expected Result | Status |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| T-01 | Home -> Explore Navigation | Click `Explore Cars` CTA button on `index.html` | Navigates to `pages/explore-cars.html` | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-02 | Home Brand Shortcut | Click `Honda` in Popular Brands on `index.html` | Opens `explore-cars.html?brand=Honda` with Honda pre-checked | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-03 | Explore Search & Sort | Type `Civic` in search bar; change Sort to `Price: Low to High` | Filters matching cars and updates result count | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-04 | Explore Filters & Empty State | Check `Hatchback` + `Rs. 1 Cr & above` and click `Apply` | Shows `\\\"No matching cars found\\\"` with working `Reset Filters` button | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-05 | Car Details Gallery | Open `Honda Civic`, click thumbnail 2 and thumbnail 3 | Main image swaps and active border highlights selected thumbnail | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-06 | Wishlist Persistence | Click `♡ Wishlist` on Car Details, reload page, open `Saved Cars` | Badge count stays `1`, button stays `♥ Saved in Wishlist`, car appears in modal | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-07 | Booking Flow State 4 (Error) | Click `BOOK`, enter invalid phone (`123`) or email (`abc`), click `Submit` | Shows `\\\"Incorrect phone number or email. Please enter again.\\\"` + `Try Again` | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-08 | Booking Flow State 3 (Success) | Click `Try Again`, enter valid phone (`03001234567`) & email, submit | Shows `\\\"Booking Confirmed!\\\"` with car name, date, time, and `Back to Car` | Pending Browser Check |\\n| T-09 | Mobile Responsiveness | Resize browser to `375px` width on all 3 pages | Hamburger menu toggles, cards stack vertically, mobile filter drawer opens/closes | Pending Browser Check |\\n\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\CarVault project\\\\docs\\\\testing-log.md\""}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"# CAR VAULT — User Feedback & Change Log Notes (Hamza Taqvim, 26I-3054)\\n\\nUse this file to track feedback collected from your Google Form sessions and record what you changed on the website (to include in `docs/Prototype_and_Feedback_Report.pdf`).\\n\\n## Feedback Session Checklist (CL1000 Requirements)\\n- [ ] At least **2 feedback sessions** conducted on your 3 pages\\n- [ ] At least **1 photo per session** showing Hamza Taqvim, the participant, and the physical prototype chart saved in `docs/feedback-photos/` (named `26i-3054_session1.jpg`, `26i-3054_session2.jpg`)\\n- [ ] Photos of Hamza visible with horizontal & vertical prototype charts saved in `docs/prototype-photos/`\\n- [ ] Google Form responses collected (Consent question + Task completion + 1–5 ratings + Open feedback)\\n\\n## Change Table Template\\n\\n| Feedback Received | Page | Member | Decision | Reason | Change Made on Website |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| *[Add feedback 1 from Google Form]* | Explore Cars | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) | Change / Keep | *[Reason]* | *[Change made]* |\\n| *[Add feedback 2 from Google Form]* | Car Details | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) | Change / Keep | *[Reason]* | *[Change made]* |\\n\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\OneDrive\\\\Desktop\\\\CarVault project\\\\docs\\\\feedback-log.md\""}},{"name":"invoke_subagent","args":{"Model":"\"inherit\"","Prompt":"\"Generate a minimalist luxury automotive dealership logo icon for \\\"CAR VAULT\\\" on a solid dark navy (#111827) background. A sleek geometric car silhouette combined with a vault shield/crest in brushed metallic gold (#D9A441), clean vector style, no text, centered, square 1:1 composition. Save to artifact directory.\"","Role":"\"Logo Image Generator\"","TypeName":"\"image-generator\""}},{"name":"invoke_subagent","args":{"Model":"\"inherit\"","Prompt":"\"Generate a realistic automotive interior photograph of a modern 2026 Honda Civic sedan cabin dashboard, steering wheel, digital instrument cluster, and infotainment screen in dark charcoal and brushed metallic trim, bright showroom lighting, 16:9 aspect, no text or watermarks. Save to artifact directory.\"","Role":"\"Honda Civic Interior Generator\"","TypeName":"\"image-generator\""}},{"name":"invoke_subagent","args":{"Model":"\"inherit\"","Prompt":"\"Generate a realistic studio/showroom photograph of a 2026 Honda Civic sedan rear three-quarter angle in sleek metallic grey inside a modern luxury car dealership showroom, sharp LED taillights visible, 16:9 aspect, no text or watermarks. Save to artifact directory.\"","Role":"\"Honda Civic Rear Generator\"","TypeName":"\"image-generator\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
